IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `efma-work-passes`

-- Employment of Foreign Manpower Act 1990, ss 5, 6A, 9, 10, 11, 12, 22A, 22B, 23A, 25, 25G, 27 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_employment-of-foreign-manpower-act-1990.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

